      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "35",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dia Yehowa diakalua kudi Yelemiya mu matuku a Yehoyakima, muana wa Yoshiya, mukelenge wa Yuda, ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya ku nsubu wa Bena Lekaba, uyikile nʼabo, ulue nʼabo mu nsubu mukuabo wa mu nsubu wa Yehowa, ubaheshe maluvu a nvinyo bua kunuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku nakangata Yâzanya, muana wa Yelemiya, muana wa Habasinya, ne bana babo ba mu diku diandi, ne bana bandi balume bonso ne bantu bonso bakadi mu nsubu wa Bena Lekaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakalua nʼabo ku nsubu wa Yehowa, mu nsubu mua bana balume ba Hanana, muana mulume wa Yigedalaya, muntu wa Nzambi, wakadi ha buihi ne nsubu wa baminyampala, wakadi ha mutu ha nsubu wa Maseya, muana wa Shaluma, mulami wa ku mbelu kua nsubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakateka malonga akadi ne nvinyo tente ne mpanza ya kunua nʼai ku mpala kua bana balume ba tshiota tshia Bena Lekaba; nakabambila ne, Nuai nvinyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bakamba ne, Katuena tunua nvinyo nansha; bualu bua Yonadaba, muana wa Lekaba, nkambua wetu, wakatuelela mukenji ne, Kanunu nvinyo, nansha nuenu nansha bana benu balume tshiendelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanuashi nsubu, kanukunyi maminu, kanukunyi mionshi ya tumuma tua nvinyo mu budimi, kanuikadi nʼabi; kadi nushikame mu ntenta matuku enu onso; bua nuenu nuikale ne muoyo matuku a bungi mu buloba bunudi bashikamemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuetu tuakutumikila dî dia Yonadaba, muana wa Lekaba, nkambua wetu, mu malu onso akatuambileye bua tuetu tuenze bua katunu nvinyo matuku etu onso, nansha tuetu, nansha bakashi betu, nansha bana betu balume, nansha bana betu bakashi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua katuashi nsubu bua kushikamamu; bua katuikadi ne budimi bua mionshi ya tumuma tua nvinyo, bua katuikadi ne budimi, anyi maminu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi tuakushikama mu ntenta, tuakulonda mikenji yonso yakatuelela Yonadaba nkambua wetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi mu diba edi, hakabuela Nebukadenesâ, mukelenge wa Babulona, mu buloba ebu tuakambilangana ne, Luai tubande ku Yelushalema bua ditshina dietu dia masalayi a Bena Kasada, ne bua ditshina dietu dia masalayi a Bena Sulia; nunku tudi bashikame mu Yelushalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu diba adi dî dia Yehowa diakalua kudi Yelemiya ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Ya wambile Bena Yuda ne ba mu Yelushalema ne, Yehowa udi ukonka ne, Kanuena nuitabusha diyisha bua nuenu kutumikila mei anyi, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakuenza mei a Yonadaba, muana wa Lekaba, akambileye bana bandi balume, ne, Kanunu maluvu a nvinyo. Tô ne lelu eu kabena banua, bualu bua badi batumikila mukenji wa nkambua wabo. Kadi meme nakunuambila dî dianyi, mbika bianyi ne lunkelu bua kunuambiladi, kanuena nungunvuila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakunutumina kabidi bena mudimu banyi honso, baprofete mene, mbika ne lunkelu bua kubatuma kunudi bua kunuambila ne, Muntu yonso alekele kuenda mu nshila wandi mubi, alongolole bienzedi biandi, kalondi nzambi mikuabo bua kuyikuatshila mudimu, bua nushikame mu buloba bunakanuha nuenu ne batatu benu. Kadi kanuakuteleja matshu enu kundi, kanuakungunvuila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, bualu bua bana balume ba Yonadaba, muana wa Lekaba, bakutumikila dî dia nkambua wabo diakabambileye, kadi bantu aba kabakungunvuila; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nunku Yehowa, Nzambi wa misumba, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Monai, nentumine Bena Yuda ne bantu bonso ba mu Yelushalema makenga onso anakubambila; bualu bua nakubambila dî, ne kabena bunvua, nakubabikila, ne kabena bitabe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yelemiya wakambila ba mu nsubu wa Lekaba kabidi ne, Yehowa wa misumba, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Bualu bua nuakutumikila mukenji wa Yonadaba, nkambua wenu, nuakulonda mei andi onso, nuakuenza malu onso akanuambileye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nunku Yehowa wa misumba, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Yonadaba, muana wa Lekaba, kena uhanga muana mulume bua kuimaneye ku mpala kuanyi tshiendelele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
